cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Replication Package: Ex-Ante Economic Impacts of the African Continental Free Trade Area (AfCFTA)"
abstract: >-
  This repository contains the replication package for the empirical analysis 
  of the ex-ante economic impacts of the African Continental Free Trade Area 
  (AfCFTA) agreement using structural gravity models with PPML estimation and 
  General Equilibrium counterfactual simulations.
